// Read-back helpers and a populated-table setup for tally/'s own cases.
// bump/find/maybe/add/inc/report/line all need words/counts declared
// (main.id's init() is their sole export), and inc/report/line need a
// non-empty table too, which wc2_setup gives them through bump() itself
// rather than a second export of the same names.

wc2_setup() {
  init();
  bump("a");
  bump("b");
} return void;
():() then len((import words)):(2)
():() then (import counts)[0]:(1)

